DESCRIPTION:Friday Crafternoons Unwind from the week at Friday Crafternoon
 \, a free weekly social circle for fiber arts enthusiasts. Grab your proje
 ct bags and join fellow makers for a relaxing afternoon of knitting\, croc
 het\, embroidery\, cross-stitch\, or any portable needlework. Whether you 
 are starting a fresh project or fixing a dropped stitch\, our complimentar
 y on-site Stitch Support is here to troubleshoot tricky patterns and guide
  beginners. Drop in at any time to connect with local makers who share a p
 assion for handmade things. 📅 When: Every Friday | 3:00 PM &#8211\; 6:0
 0 PM 📍 Where: The Craftery Studio | 450 Main St\, Unit A\, Warren\, RI 
 02885 💰 Cost: Completely free to attend\n\nSource: https://www.visitrho
 deisland.com/event/friday-crafternoons-in-warren/111788/
LOCATION:The Craftery Studio\, 450 Main Street\, Unit A\, Warren\, RI 0288
 5
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/friday-crafternoons-in-warren/1
 11788/
END:VEVENT
