BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Charlie the Butler Ghost Party with Jared the Magician and Mentali
 st at Gov. Sprague Mansion
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261023
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTSTAMP:20261023T153620Z
UID:5db5fc402b7a28c8ff89881d0de3@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Oct. 23 at 7pm. Rhode Island’s Jared the Magician and Mental
 ist will entertain guests at the spoooooky Governor Sprague Mansion on FRI
 DAY\, OCTOBER 23 at 7:00 p.m. The Cranston Historical Society invites you 
 to their annual Charlie the Butler Ghost Party fundraising event. Maybe Ch
 arlie will make an appearance. See for yourself if Jared really can read y
 our mind. To purchase tickets and reserve your place at $20 call (401) 944
 -9226. Seating limited. The Ghost Party at the Governor Sprague Mansion ha
 s been a fundraising event for over 14 years. Jared the Magician and Menta
 list will amuse guests with an ‘. . . array of eye-popping slight-of-han
 d miracles -- join him for mind-bending experiments through reading\, meta
 l bending\, and persuasion &#8211\; Seemingly impossible predictions are r
 evealed”. Jared Dubois from Warwick\, has performed his mystifying illus
 ions across the country. You will wonder how he does his magical phenomeno
 n! Listen . . .Is someone upstairs? Find out after Jared performs and enjo
 y a hauntingly good time roaming some of the mansion rooms. Costumes are o
 ptional &#8211\; please no masks. Have your future read by intriguing read
 er Ms. Mallory -- The Beachlady3 for a separate fee. Enjoy the Mansion’s
  special Blood Punch! Age appropriate for 14 years. Send your check by Oct
 ober 20 payable to Cranston Historical Society\, 1351 Cranston Street\, Cr
 anston\, RI 02920 (401) 944-9226. (After October 20 call Charlie the Butle
 r to make sure tickets are still available.) Cranston Historical Society i
 s a 501 (c)(3) nonprofit historical and educational organization. To host 
 your next special event\, meeting or tea call (401)944-9226. Celebrating C
 ranston 250.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/charlie-the
 -butler-ghost-party-with-jared-the-magician-and-mentalist-at-gov-sprague-m
 ansion/112024/
LOCATION:Governor Sprague Mansion\, 1351 Cranston Street\, Cranston\, 0292
 0
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/charlie-the-butler-ghost-party-
 with-jared-the-magician-and-mentalist-at-gov-sprague-mansion/112024/
END:VEVENT
